[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-18T14:49:29-08:00","id":13630,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/13547-in-which-i-rant-about-sex-and-stuff?p=13591#post13591\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, since you mention a woman and wanting to sleep with her... honestly? My advice (for lack of a better term) would would be to meet her, talk to her directly and find out why why wants a virgin and what she is ultimately looking for. If everything is compatible and you both get what you want out of the encounter/relationship... then go for it?<br /> <br /> Just make sure you sort out what each of you are actually looking for out of it. Maybe she's looking for a one-night notch on a bedpost kind of encounter, maybe she's looking for someone she can teach, maybe she's looking to help someone discover what does and doesn't appeal to them. Maybe she's looking for someone insecure and moderately easy to manipulate that looks good in a bit and bridle. First step is talking and answering those questions.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is a very reasonable idea and I don't know why I didn't think of it myself. I should totally talk to her myself. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/13547-in-which-i-rant-about-sex-and-stuff?p=13591#post13591\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh and that awkwardness you feel about having a friend even peripherally involved in your sex life... Ummmm, I'm trying to figure out how to say this in a way that won't shock but... Get used to it? You hang out with people that you don't want sex with because you share interests. You hang out with people that you do want sex with because you share interests. Sometimes either one results in sexxoring happening. You will have friends hook up (or even marry) your ex's, you will be introduced to your brother's new bride and remember that mildly drunken meeting at a convention 3 years before. It happens.</div> </div> </div> </div>I guess. It still feels a bit off to be served up like a that. I don't know. I might be making too much of it. As I said, I've only heard this from him, and I'm not sure how faithful his quotes are.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-18T17:58:00-08:00","id":13713,"tit